### V. Characteristics of AI Content and Responsibility for Use

AI output is generated by models and may contain errors, omissions, outdated information, or misunderstandings of image or voice content, and may generate similar content for different users. Please verify independently before relying on it, publishing it publicly, or using it for important decisions.

AI output does not replace professional advice provided by qualified professionals in medical, legal, financial, or other fields. For matters involving personal safety, property, or other significant rights and interests, please consult the corresponding professional institutions.

Your rights in the input content in accordance with law are not transferred by your use of the Application. To complete the service you request, the relevant content will be processed to the extent necessary. Whether AI output can constitute protected work and whether it can be used for specific commercial purposes depends on applicable law, the input content, and the third-party service terms; this Agreement does not promise that the output is exclusive or will never infringe third-party rights.

